   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 20,
   "start": 273.53,
   "dur": 4.07,
   "speech": "先记住这个对照，验证页会再看它一眼。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 21,
   "start": 277.78,
   "dur": 4.57,
   "speech": "第二种失败更隐蔽：模型学了，阈值不迁移。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 22,
   "start": 282.53,
   "dur": 3.4,
   "speech": "二〇二一年以后，波动结构换了。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 23,
   "start": 286.11,
   "dur": 5.29,
   "speech": "干净窗的重构误差整体抬高，训练段的尺子就不准了。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 24,
   "start": 291.58,
   "dur": 5.39,
   "speech": "拿二〇二〇年的九十九分位当阈值，七成干净点被误报。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 25,
   "start": 297.15,
   "dur": 5.03,
   "speech": "报警率 70.26%，召回 99.64%。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 26,
   "start": 302.36,
   "dur": 5.39,
   "speech": "召回好看，是因为阈值太低；精确率只有 0.2912。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 27,
   "start": 307.93,
   "dur": 4.55,
   "speech": "这不是 bug，是分布漂移下阈值法的固有代价。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 28,
   "start": 312.66,
   "dur": 4.98,
   "speech": "变分自编码器解决第一种失败：给潜空间一个先验。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 29,
   "start": 317.82,
   "dur": 4.91,
   "speech": "它解决不了第二种；后面会看到它也误报六成。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 30,
   "start": 322.91,
   "dur": 4.41,
   "speech": "两个失败要分开说，否则容易把功劳记错。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 31,
   "start": 327.5,
   "dur": 2.65,
   "speech": "先把两个损失写出来。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 32,
   "start": 330.33,
   "dur": 4.26,
   "speech": "公式不多，但每个细节都会影响后面的数。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 0,
   "start": 338,
   "dur": 3.42,
   "speech": "自编码器这一页只有三行公式。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 1,
   "start": 341.6,
   "dur": 3.85,
   "speech": "编码器把一百维窗口压成十六维。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 2,
   "start": 345.64,
   "dur": 3.45,
   "speech": "解码器再把它还原成一百维。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 3,
   "start": 349.26,
   "dur": 3.57,
   "speech": "目标是最小化重构误差平方和。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 4,
   "start": 353.01,
   "dur": 4.29,
   "speech": "去噪版本在输入上加一层伯努利掩码。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 5,
   "start": 357.47,
   "dur": 4.6,
   "speech": "掩码把一部分点抹成零，再去还原干净输入。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 6,
   "start": 362.25,
   "dur": 4.74,
   "speech": "注意这个不对称：破坏输入，目标还是原来的 X。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 7,
   "start": 367.17,
   "dur": 3.97,
   "speech": "这逼着编码器学结构，而不是学恒等。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 8,
   "start": 371.33,
   "dur": 4.33,
   "speech": "但书里的自编码器没有先验，也没有采样。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 9,
   "start": 375.84,
   "dur": 4.45,
   "speech": "变分自编码器把潜变量当成随机变量。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 10,
   "start": 380.48,
   "dur": 3.83,
   "speech": "编码器不输出一个点，输出一个分布。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 11,
   "start": 384.49,
   "dur": 3.49,
   "speech": "均值一个头，对数方差一个头。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 12,
   "start": 388.16,
   "dur": 4.77,
   "speech": "式(4.22)：损失等于重构期望加 KL 散度。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 13,
   "start": 393.11,
   "dur": 5.32,
   "speech": "采样用重参数化：Z 等于 mu 加 sigma 乘 eps。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 14,
   "start": 398.6,
   "dur": 4.29,
   "speech": "eps 从标准正态里抽，和参数无关。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 15,
   "start": 403.07,
   "dur": 3.73,
   "speech": "这样梯度能穿过采样回到编码器。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 16,
   "start": 406.98,
   "dur": 3.57,
   "speech": "否则采样这一步会把梯度路断掉。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 17,
   "start": 410.73,
   "dur": 6.06,
   "speech": "先验固定成 N(0,I)，KL 就是后验离先验多远。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 18,
   "start": 416.97,
   "dur": 3.85,
   "speech": "这一项同时起两个作用：约束和正则。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 19,
   "start": 421.01,
   "dur": 2.68,
   "speech": "先看 KL 怎么算。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 20,
   "start": 423.86,
   "dur": 3.37,
   "speech": "KL 有解析式，不用采样估计。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 21,
   "start": 427.42,
   "dur": 5.05,
   "speech": "KL 等于二分之一乘以 mu 平方加 sigma 平方减一。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 22,
   "start": 432.65,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speech": "再减去 log sigma 平方。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 23,
   "start": 435.63,
   "dur": 4.09,
   "speech": "我们对每个维度求和，再对窗口取平均。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 24,
   "start": 439.9,
   "dur": 3.66,
   "speech": "学的是 log sigma 平方，不是 sigma。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 25,
   "start": 443.75,
   "dur": 3.47,
   "speech": "因为它可以取负，数值上更稳。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 26,
   "start": 447.4,
   "dur": 5.46,
   "speech": "黄金值：mu 等于一、logvar 等于零，KL 是 0.5。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 27,
   "start": 453.04,
   "dur": 3.95,
   "speech": "mu 和 logvar 都为零时，KL 是零。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
